    <briefdescription>
<para>HTTP Metrics Client. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Sends quality control metrics to HTTP endpoints for continuous learning. Features:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Batched metric uploads</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Automatic retry with exponential backoff</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Connection pooling</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>SSL/TLS support</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Authentication (Bearer token)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Request/response logging </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
